&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Location: Broadway Dance Center 322 West 45th Street New York City&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Doors open at 7am&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Auditions from 8am to 1pm&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Auditions only for resident in New York and Connecticut&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Auditioners must be 21 or over&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring proper identification showing current address&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Auditioners must come dressed to dance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Auditioners must NOT wear clothing with visible logos/brands, since all auditions may be filmed for use in future promotional content&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
